AgentarRuntimeError <|-- NotAssignableError
AgentarRuntimeError <|-- MinusValueForSquare

' Associations / compositions
AgentarSystem "1" o-- "0..*" AgentInstance : manages
AgentarSystem "1" o-- "0..*" AgentRunner : threads
AgentRunner --> AgentInstance : instance
AgentRunner --> AgentarSystem : system
AgentRunner --> AgentId : agent_id

AgentInstance --> StatementExecutor
AgentInstance --> ExpressionEvaluator
AgentInstance --> MessageHandler
AgentInstance --> ActionExecutor
AgentInstance --> AgentId
AgentInstance --> AgentarAgent : from declaration
AgentInstance --> AgentarSystem : _runtime

ActionExecutor --> VariableContainer
MessageHandler --> MessageInstance
MessageInstance --> VariableContainer

AgentContainer --> AgentarAgent
MessageContainer --> AgentarMessage
VariableContainer --> VariableInfo
VariableContainer --> Pointer
TypedList --> Pointer
TypedDict --> Pointer
TypedTuple --> Pointer

' Notes
note top of AgentarSystem
  This diagram includes only runtime/core classes.
  AST nodes and the ANTLR-generated parser are omitted.
end note

@enduml
